for my reception. They are painted a shiny silver and looked gorgeous with my beach theme.<br>\n10 medium sized starfish<br>\n23 small knobby starfish<br>\nSelling all for $25 plus shipping if needed.<br><br><br>\n17 Purple Lanyards with Card Holders - $20:<br>\nBrand new, never used. These are leftover items from my out of town bags I put together for my wedding. <br><br><br>\n14 Plastic Tumblers with Lids & Straws - $10:<br>\nBrand new, never used and still in the store box. I bought a case for wedding favors and these were left over. 16-oz. Double-Wall Plastic Tumblers with Screw-On Lids and Plastic Straws.<br><br>\nI included a picture with my wedding stickers for ideas but the ones I am selling do not have the stickers. <br>\n14 in total<br>\n6 turquoise <br>\n8 clear<br>\nExtra straws and lids included<br><br><br>\n36 Small Bubble Wands - $10<br>\nStill in box, never used. I added a purple ribbon which you can remove easily. The top of each wand is heart shaped.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421692870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80220","Title":"Wedding Items For Sale","LastPostDate":1469950414},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
