pan><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><span  style=\"font-size:14pt\">*PRICES ARE IN CANADIAN DOLLARS*<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Buyer pays shipping; also open to GTA drop-off or pick-up <\/em><\/strong><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">J<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:14pt\">10 GOLD SEQUIN<\/span><\/strong><strong><span  style=\"font-size:14pt\"> TABLE RUNNERS<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Purchased on ChairCoverFactory.com for $17.40 each ($174.00)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:1in\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new';\">o\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00e0<\/span> Please remember this is in Canadian and includes the shipping I paid<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:1in\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new';\">o\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00e0<\/span><\/span><\/em><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"> On the site they are called champagne, but by my photos you can see they are the perfect shade of gold (in my opinion!)<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<p>-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Asking $85.00 for all or $50.00 for 5<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84481-table-runner-various-gold-frames-8x10-blush-frame-5x7-blush-frame-white-and-gold-tealights-gold-stands\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18240\/sml_gallery_282006_18240_1142229.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='table runner   various gold frames   8x10 blush fram